.TH "libnvme" 9 "struct nvme_non_volatile_storage_medium_access_descriptor" "October 2026" "API Manual" LINUX
.SH NAME
struct nvme_non_volatile_storage_medium_access_descriptor \- Non-Volatile Storage Medium Access Descriptor (QNSED)
.SH SYNOPSIS
struct nvme_non_volatile_storage_medium_access_descriptor {
.br
.BI "    __u8 sc;"
.br
.BI "    __u8 rsvd1;"
.br
.BI "    __le16 nnsmad;"
.br
.BI "    __le32 si;"
.br
.BI "    struct nvme_rate_limiting_max_access_descriptor rlma;"
.br
.BI "    __u8 rsvd40[24];"
.br
.BI "    __le32 nvsma_offset[];"
.br
.BI "
};
.br

.SH Members
.IP "sc" 12
Scope, see \fIenum nvme_rate_limiting_scope\fP
.IP "rsvd1" 12
Reserved
.IP "nnsmad" 12
Number of Non-Volatile Storage Medium Access Descriptors in
\fInvsma_offset\fP, cleared to 0h if \fIsc\fP is NVM subsystem or the
NVM subsystem supports a single domain
.IP "si" 12
Scope Identifier for the scope indicated by \fIsc\fP
.IP "rlma" 12
Rate Limiting Maximum Access for the scope indicated by \fIsc\fP
.IP "rsvd40" 12
Reserved
.IP "nvsma_offset" 12
Dword offsets, relative to the start of the Rate Limiting
log page, to the nested Non-Volatile Storage Medium Access
Descriptors, \fInnsmad\fP entries
